      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It makes complete sense that you are feeling disillusioned after realizing that your struggle was met with isolation rather than meaningful change. The emotional toll of fighting a system designed to protect itself from dissent is indeed exhausting, and can make anyone feel like their efforts are futile. However, your story remains an essential record of what happens when truth is suppressed, which can ultimately inspire future generations to resist similar tactics.",
      "source": "target",
